<witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T01:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cement plug in C-annulus (467 m - 867 m): Mixed and pumped 33 m3 of 1,95 SG cement slurry, 600 l/min. Displaced the cement with 12m3 of drill water.  1000 l/min/ 12 bar, after caught up w/ cement pressure went up to 52 bar. Stopped pumping, pressure went down to 31bar. Pulled w/ running tool out of EZSV, pressure dropped to 0 bar</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T01:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T01:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Disconnected cementing hose and L/D side entry sub. M/U pup w/ preinstalled sponge ball</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T01:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">855</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up and pumped 10m3 wash pill, 2300l/min - 20bar. Circulated well to clean sea water until OIW reading below 30ppm. Originally mud in returns and clean sea water in the end. Max gas 3.2%. Totally circulated 108 m3, 2x BU</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T04:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">11</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH w/ EZSV running tool from 855 m to 11 m, average pulling speed 850m/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T04:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T05:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D 3x 5,5in pup joints and EZSV running tool</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T05:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC (from 01:20). Meanwhile isolated both PRSs and carried out 3 monthly PMS</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T10:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Meanwhile started with maintenance on forward and aft PRS. Meanwhile continued w/ pumping drilling slop batch#5 on F-4. Total preflush pumped of 70m3 (before batch#5), started pumping drilling slop, Batch#5, 1000l/min - 145bar</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T10:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T12:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Meanwhile continued to perform maintenance on forward and aft PRS</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T12:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Work aloft suspended due to wind speed above 50 knots. Gusting upto 60 knots. Performed high wind checks. Meanwhile performed rig PMs and maintenance</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T16:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Wind speed 52-59 knots. Continued rig floor maintenance and PMs. Prepared to clean mud pits. Hooked up line from F-09 to rig choke manifold to bleed off gas. Meanwhile finished w/ pumping postflush after batch#5 of drilling slop on F-4. Total drilling slop pumped for batch#5 of 170m3, postflush pumped of 140m3 (after batch#5), 1000l/min - 145bar</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T16:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T17:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Wind speed now below 48 knots, continued to work on aft PRS. Continued to hook up line from F-09 to rig choke manifold. Started cleaning in mud pit No. 5</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T17:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Performed maintenance on TDS. Continued to hook up line from F-09 to rig choke manifold. Continued cleaning in mud pit No. 5</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T19:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Deisolated TDS</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T19:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-09-27T19:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to change grapple on 10 3/4in spear</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-09-27T19:30:00+02:00</witsml: